TI  - Systematic comparison of fluorescence imaging in the near-infrared and shortwave-infrared spectral range using clinical tumor samples containing cetuximab-IRDye800CW.
T2  - J Biomed Opt
JF  - J Biomed Opt
VL  - 30
IS  - Suppl 1
SP  - S13708
